# `agent.grant`

Grant restricted capabilities to an agent (operator approval). Upgrades the agent's live sessions; the next gated call passes. C2 — operator-only, the human-in-the-loop approval point.

**Policy** — command `[C2_ELEVATED]`. Capability `ship.agents.grant`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `agent` | `string` |
| `grants` | `string[]` |

## Returns

`JsonResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `json` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agent.grant --json '{ "agent": "", "grants": [] }'
```

Kind: command.

